{"about_the_game":"Railborn is a survival game where you build your train piece by piece. Navigate a world entangled by branching tracks. Find rare plants to cultivate on your farms. Upgrade your train - manage its power systems, direct resource flow, and distribute water. Designed for 1 to 4 players.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Railborn_Header_Features.png?t=1751579617\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Railborn_Header_Train.png?t=1751579617\" /></div>Construct your train piece by piece, floor by floor, railcar by railcar.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/FeaturePiecebyPieceBorderTest.gif?t=1751579617\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Railborn_Header_MP.png?t=1751579617\" /></div>Play alone or in co-op mode with your friends.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Railborn_Header_TrackWorld.png?t=1751579617\" /></div>Navigate branching paths that carve through mountains and dive into the sea.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Feature_NavigateMachineBorder.gif?t=1751579617\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Railborn_Header_Survive.png?t=1751579617\" /></div>Beyond the train lies a hostile, dying world.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Railborn_Header_Manage.png?t=1751579617\" /></div>Manage power systems, direct resource flow, capture and distribute water.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Feature_ManageWalkThroughBorder.gif?t=1751579617\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Railborn_Header_Biomes.png?t=1751579617\" /></div>Recreate biomes on your train.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Railborn_Header_Mystery.png?t=1751579617\" /></div>Uncover the truth behind a planet consumed by endless tracks.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Railborn_Header_Rescue.png?t=1751579617\" /></div>Pilot your train up the ultimate track rising into space.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/extras/Feature_RescuePlanetBorder.gif?t=1751579617\" /></div>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2340970?t=1751579617","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/bba558ec896c70bc300535a962adbd0a6d7440c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751579617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2340970/6cadf814cbabf3c64476df2fc16335efda4fa025/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751579617","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/